      "id": "invoice-edit-save",
      "name": "Invoice editing and persistence",
      "description": "Compose events update editable StateFlow; model-derived totals; ViewModel coroutine persists invoice then associated catalogs; callback navigates to preview. Long-press row handle -> pointer-based insertion and auto-scroll -> release -> moveItem stable ID -> renumber STT -> persist/export the reordered list. Per-row InvoiceItem.note is editable, persisted and wrapped in both PDF/image templates. Editor isSaving blocks repeated saves; repository Mutex serializes all invoice mutations and AtomicFile commits before StateFlow publication. Save errors remain in editor with a friendly message; home and payment callers handle persistence failures. Saved empty lists stay empty after restart.",
